WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.240
In today's challenge episode:

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:02.040
We're going to attempt

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:03.480
the unreturnable serve

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:04.240
See if hearing

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:05.120
affects ping pong

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:05.800
and more!

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:06.720
Let's get into it!

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:08.520
Three table tic-tac-toe 

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:09.200
Let's go!

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:11.640
Yes!

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:13.680
No!

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:17.000
I need one more

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:20.440
Oooooh!

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:21.480
I need the back one

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:23.920
You got the middle

00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:27.640
I have two chances

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:29.480
You have three chances!

00:00:34.720 --> 00:00:35.720
Oooooh!

00:00:37.880 --> 00:00:38.840
You took it from me!

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:42.160
Come on!

00:00:42.320 --> 00:00:42.920
Thank you!

00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:43.800
Good game!

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:45.640
That was fun!

00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:47.240
The idea is to serve a serve

00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:48.320
so short

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:49.720
that it bounces 

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:50.920
onto the metal part

00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:52.560
and rolls

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:53.840
on the table!

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:54.640
Easy peasy!

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:55.400
Ten tries?

00:00:55.480 --> 00:00:57.040
10 000 tries

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:04.520
Oh!

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:06.560
Miikka, I think it's still bouncing there

00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:07.040
Now you see

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:08.200
what we are trying!

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:12.480
Come and join the fun

00:01:12.520 --> 00:01:14.880
of trying the impossible serve!

00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:18.600
All this effort

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:20.240
just to get a net serve!

00:01:25.640 --> 00:01:26.480
Come on Michael!

00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:27.080
You can do it!

00:01:27.160 --> 00:01:28.920
I think I need the good luck gong

00:01:35.960 --> 00:01:36.800
Lunatic!

00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:44.240
THE GONG WORKED!

00:01:44.440 --> 00:01:46.160
We were almost losing it

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:47.880
after 90 minutes

00:01:48.440 --> 00:01:49.320
You didn't even need

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:50.200
the chocolate break

00:01:50.240 --> 00:01:50.760
No!

00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:51.680
We have this challenge

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:52.200
where we build

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:53.560
the biggest chocolate racket

00:01:53.600 --> 00:01:55.760
If we hit 5 million subscribers 

00:01:57.920 --> 00:01:59.080
Yes!

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:01.640
There's a fly!

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:02.880
It's not there anymore!

00:02:02.920 --> 00:02:04.400
Let's try to swat

00:02:04.400 --> 00:02:05.600
some ping pong balls!

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:10.000
It's like a badminton racket

00:02:13.240 --> 00:02:13.600
Okay!

00:02:13.640 --> 00:02:14.240
Should we move on

00:02:14.320 --> 00:02:15.560
to the electric swatter?

00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:17.640
Oh!

00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:20.880
Anybody has water?

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:22.640
I think I've read in the school that

00:02:22.640 --> 00:02:23.960
that's not the best combination?

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:25.360
But we'll see...

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:34.520
Bouncy ball plus

00:02:34.600 --> 00:02:36.040
world's spinniest table

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:37.400
I think I need my bandana for this

00:02:37.480 --> 00:02:38.520
I've just washed my hair

00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:40.000
so it's all fluffy and in my eyes

00:02:40.080 --> 00:02:41.000
Don't lie, Miikka

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:42.240
You never wash your hair

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:44.920
Okay!

00:02:45.760 --> 00:02:47.000
The bounce is hard!

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:51.040
Whoa!

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:51.640
Yes!

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:55.040
That was dangerous!

00:02:57.280 --> 00:02:58.840
Nobody in this hall is safe

00:02:58.960 --> 00:03:00.480
We haven't tried the spin yet

00:03:05.560 --> 00:03:06.560
Wooh!

00:03:11.280 --> 00:03:13.000
How did it bounce that way?

00:03:13.360 --> 00:03:14.480
Put a bit more spin

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:15.800
Oh, that's good!

00:03:22.280 --> 00:03:23.760
We're going to need some safety equipment

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:24.920
for the next challenge

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:26.120
Safety first!

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:27.920
Otto, why does this sound like

00:03:27.960 --> 00:03:29.360
Sensei racket on steroids?

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:30.480
I boosted it!

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:31.200
Let's go!

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:33.840
Okay!

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:36.600
I'm a bit scared

00:03:36.680 --> 00:03:37.720
I'm terrified!

00:03:42.960 --> 00:03:43.560
Yes!

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:45.720
They are playing surprisingly well

00:03:45.840 --> 00:03:46.640
I try between the legs

00:03:51.320 --> 00:03:52.560
Do not try this at home!

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:54.120
Or anywhere else either!

00:03:57.320 --> 00:03:58.720
Wow!

00:03:59.520 --> 00:04:00.000
Okay!

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:00.600
Coming!

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:01.800
Oih!

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:04.880
Whoa!

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:08.440
Whoa!

00:04:15.760 --> 00:04:16.480
Got it!

00:04:17.320 --> 00:04:18.040
Still got it!

00:04:18.520 --> 00:04:19.080
Oih!

00:04:21.520 --> 00:04:22.200
I think we're done

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:23.080
Let's go find out 

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:24.080
how they are feeling...

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:24.640
after this!

00:04:24.960 --> 00:04:26.440
It was actually really fun!

00:04:26.480 --> 00:04:28.280
And it was a really good exercise

00:04:28.360 --> 00:04:30.280
You can skip all the jogging and

00:04:30.360 --> 00:04:31.520
you can just go play

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:32.840
table tennis in a truck!

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:34.640
Let's move on to the next challenge

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:36.880
So the idea is to get one shot on

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:38.480
then go one meter back...

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:39.640
Another shot

00:04:39.680 --> 00:04:40.760
One meter back

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:42.720
I think six should be possible

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:44.920
Eight is realistic

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:46.160
Four meters!

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:47.800
Let's show Lassi

00:04:47.960 --> 00:04:48.840
what we are made of!

00:04:48.960 --> 00:04:50.080
Let's prove him wrong!

00:04:51.480 --> 00:04:52.440
One meter

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:53.600
Two

00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:55.720
Three?

00:04:56.040 --> 00:04:57.320
Are you Otto sure?

00:04:57.440 --> 00:04:58.360
Eight meters? 

00:04:58.440 --> 00:04:58.960
Yeah!

00:04:59.280 --> 00:05:01.120
I feel like I've got the distance

00:05:01.520 --> 00:05:02.080
One!

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:03.920
Two!

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:06.040
Three!

00:05:07.800 --> 00:05:08.560
Four!

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:10.920
Five!

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:11.680
Good save!

00:05:12.440 --> 00:05:13.400
Six!

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:16.960
Seven!

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:19.640
Eight?

00:05:20.400 --> 00:05:22.240
Awwww!

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:24.200
Crazy dive!

00:05:24.640 --> 00:05:25.200
One

00:05:25.280 --> 00:05:25.800
Two

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:26.360
Three

00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:27.240
Four

00:05:27.360 --> 00:05:28.120
Five

00:05:28.600 --> 00:05:29.480
Six

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:32.320
Seven!

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:34.040
And?

00:05:34.040 --> 00:05:35.080
Eight!?

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:37.680
Yeah, we got it!

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:40.920
Eight meters!

00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:42.000
Almost

00:05:42.080 --> 00:05:42.600
Seven and a half

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:43.640
Okay, so we're going to try

00:05:43.680 --> 00:05:44.680
to play table tennis

00:05:44.720 --> 00:05:46.000
without hearing at all

00:05:46.080 --> 00:05:47.360
So we're going to put ear plugs

00:05:47.440 --> 00:05:48.800
and earmuffs on

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:50.520
and see how that affects gameplay

00:05:53.120 --> 00:05:54.600
I can't hear much but...

00:05:54.800 --> 00:05:57.320
I can still hear the high pitched noises!

00:05:57.400 --> 00:05:58.760
So the next phase

00:05:58.840 --> 00:06:00.400
is to have some wireless

00:06:00.720 --> 00:06:01.680
headphones 

00:06:02.280 --> 00:06:04.920
I'll even put the music as loud as possible

00:06:05.240 --> 00:06:07.200
I have to speak very loudly

00:06:07.360 --> 00:06:08.960
so that I can hear myself!

00:06:12.400 --> 00:06:12.920
Woah!

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:13.640
This is opening like

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:14.920
a new world to me!

00:06:17.280 --> 00:06:18.800
I don't think it affects so much

00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:19.520
the gameplay!

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:21.720
But it's just a cool experience!

00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:24.000
Vision with only one eye

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:25.320
so half vision

00:06:29.720 --> 00:06:30.200
Oh!

00:06:30.560 --> 00:06:32.760
I kind of like need to face more here

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:36.160
The final stage

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:37.320
is to try them both!

00:06:38.760 --> 00:06:39.560
*Hits a bird*

00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:42.120
*Hits a drone*

00:06:44.560 --> 00:06:45.080
*Hits a plane*

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:48.160
It's just edge, edge, edge!

00:06:48.280 --> 00:06:49.120
Can I try?

00:06:49.200 --> 00:06:50.760
Otto, don't say anything

00:06:50.800 --> 00:06:51.520
if you agree:

00:06:51.560 --> 00:06:53.680
That I'm a much better player than you?

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:56.280
Well, and he even nodded!

00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:00.400
It's so hard!

00:07:05.160 --> 00:07:06.320
So we need to recreate

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:07.880
Edward Scissorhands

00:07:08.080 --> 00:07:09.200
and it's going to be...

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:10.320
Emil Paddlehands

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:11.840
Why are we doing this?

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:13.080
That's a very good question!

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:15.520
I'm going to have nightmares

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:16.000
from that!

00:07:18.240 --> 00:07:18.840
Okay!

00:07:18.920 --> 00:07:19.720
Serve?

00:07:24.360 --> 00:07:24.880
Oh!

00:07:26.560 --> 00:07:27.320
Wait a second!

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:28.400
Ahhh!

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:30.720
Much better than the previous one

00:07:30.840 --> 00:07:32.200
Ready for this, Emil Paddlehands?

00:07:32.520 --> 00:07:33.000
I'm ready!

00:07:39.200 --> 00:07:39.760
Woah!

00:07:39.840 --> 00:07:40.920
You should get the all

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:42.160
You have enough rackets

00:07:45.920 --> 00:07:46.960
This is tough!

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:48.360
Like, surprisingly tough!

00:07:48.480 --> 00:07:50.400
I think we can draw the conclusion

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:52.000
that it's not an advantage

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:53.080
to have six rackets

00:07:53.120 --> 00:07:54.000
I think it's time to try

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:54.920
what I was born to do...

00:07:55.320 --> 00:07:56.520
Emil Paddlehands

00:07:56.640 --> 00:07:58.480
with six paddles on his fingers

00:07:58.560 --> 00:07:59.840
He had one goal:

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.120
Six shots on 

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:02.160
at the same time!

00:08:02.320 --> 00:08:03.360
Proving the world

00:08:03.360 --> 00:08:04.200
they're wrong!

00:08:04.440 --> 00:08:05.680
That was his only mission

00:08:07.480 --> 00:08:08.840
Everybody said he wouldn't become

00:08:08.920 --> 00:08:09.840
a table tennis player

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:11.280
Get off the table!

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:12.720
Boo!

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:13.880
He had the motivation

00:08:13.960 --> 00:08:15.680
And it's all come down to this day

